{"reviews":[{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-0","r":5.0,"t":"Great party favors!","x":"I ordered these for my daughter's uniform themed birthday party. I attached one to each favor bucket and the girls absolutely loved them! The neighbors are still wearing theirs weeks later. I haven't heard of any breaking so these were a great buy!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-1","r":4.0,"t":"Great for unicorn loving girls!","x":"These were the primary party favors for my daughter\u2019s 9th birthday party. The girls barely took them off the whole 2 days they were partying! They are a bit narrow at the base though and did create some red marks behind the girls\u2019 ears.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-2","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect! For kids or adults.","x":"These are super cute and actually stay on your head! I bought these and a few other fancy ones for my daughter's birthday and these were my preferred ones. As an adult I didn't feel silly wearing it because it was more subtle and it stayed in place ALL night. It's fits kids and adults.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-3","r":5.0,"t":"Nice quality- cute colors!","x":"Headbands fit the adult women I bought them for. Plenty of room and really cute. Didn't look too \"dinky\"! Really made a fun gift for my sister's unicorn themed bachelorette party.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-4","r":5.0,"t":"Super cute!","x":"Super cute and surprisingly great quality! My birthday girl and her friends all loved them!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-5","r":5.0,"t":"Very cute pastel colors.","x":"Including in favor bag for my 4 year old's unicorn party. Plastic seems durable.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-6","r":5.0,"t":"adorable!","x":"Got these for my daughters birthday party. They were so cute that even the adults were wearing them.  I liked that there were a couple of blue, green and yellow ones for those who don't like pink and purple.  Definitely worth the price and would buy again!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-7","r":5.0,"t":"Very cute and great value","x":"These are great, colors are nice, and they seem fairly sturdy for the price. My 12 year old son was able to get it on his head, and it also fit my 7 year old daughter well, so they work for a range of ages. Def a good price for these as well.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great for kids AND adults","x":"Used these for a bachelorette party. The girls with glasses complained about the use of them, but everybody else agreed they were comfortable and worked really well. The bride adores unicorns so we all became unicorns for the evening.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-9","r":5.0,"t":"Unicorns for life!","x":"Bought these to wear when playing Unstable Unicorns. You don\u2019t need unicorn horns to play the game, but there is something about 6-8 adults wearing unicorn horns while playing a game that makes for a great laugh!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-10","r":5.0,"t":"Sturdy headbands for a great price!","x":"Love them! Perfect unicorn party favor for kid and adult head sizes! Lots of colors to choose from. I especially love seeing the girls from the party still wearing them out and about weeks after the event \ud83d\ude42","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great for kids and adults","x":"Ordered these for our daughters birthday party. I even wore one. It fit a 4 year olds head well and even an adults. They were very sturdy, didn\u2019t even have once break and I thought they might at first.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-12","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome Party Favor","x":"I ordered these for my daughter's 3rd birthday party, and they are great!!! Very durable and comfortable to wear. They fit nicely on children and adults. Would buy again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-13","r":5.0,"t":"They are breakable so be gentle!","x":"These were a huge hit at my daughters 1st birthday. Even the adults were fighting over them! I ordered 2packs but probably should have order 3! Definitely worth it!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-14","r":5.0,"t":"Worth it!","x":"These were a hit at my daughter\u2019s unicorn themed party! I even wore one. They are very durable so the girls were able to take them home and wear them  later.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-15","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome product with awesome price","x":"These were surprisingly sturdy and cute for the price!  I ordered as give aways for my daughter's 2nd birthday. All of the little girls loved them!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-16","r":5.0,"t":"Cute headbands","x":"Just what I needed for a party favor.  Kids of all ages liked them.  Nice color variety in pack, pastel. Some have held up months after party.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-17","r":5.0,"t":"Super Cute!! Great alternative to party hats!!!!","x":"Super Cute!! Great alternative to party hats!!!! Added the perfect touch to my daughters unicorn birthday party! Everyone loved them!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-18","r":5.0,"t":"Adorables, me encantaron!","x":"Muy bellos, de muy buena calidad, los colores preciosos, muy c\u00f3modos, a las ni\u00f1as les encantaron, muy contenta con esta compra.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-19","r":5.0,"t":"Adorable and Sturdy","x":"These are great headbands. Were super hit at daughters party and  all the girls were excited to receive  one in goody bag .","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-20","r":5.0,"t":"So Fun!!","x":"I ordered these for my daughters birthday and had friends & Family wear them!!! It was a blast, these were perfect!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-21","r":5.0,"t":"Fun","x":"Bought these as a party gift at my daughter's unicorn themed b-day.  Everyone loved them- even the grown ups!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-22","r":5.0,"t":"Loved it","x":"I used it for all the little girls at the party. They all loved it and it did not break at all, very strong.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-23","r":5.0,"t":"Best value and quality","x":"Awesome. Kids teens and adults all wore them. Also stayed in place on all hair types even very thick hair.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B0BPGR3F5W-24","r":4.0,"t":"Good quality item","x":"Bought these as part of daughter goodie bags for her birthday. Nice quality the girls will love them!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Customers frequently describe the headbands as cute and a big hit at unicorn-themed parties for kids and adults alike.","cites":[1,2,5,7,10,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers say the headbands fit both children and adults well.","cites":[3,4,8,11,12,13]},{"text":"Reviewers commonly praise the headbands as durable and sturdy for the price, with several noting none broke.","cites":[1,6,8,12,13,15]},{"text":"Some customers report discomfort, including red marks behind the ears from a narrow base and complaints from wearers with glasses.","cites":[2,9]},{"text":"Several reviewers highlight the variety of nice colors, including non-pink options, as a plus.","cites":[4,6,7,8,11]}]},"qa":[]}